 -- @MAINTAINER@  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:00:00 -0500

@DISTRO_ID@-desktop (4.0.4+git20261018.97.aaffd727-0@DISTRO_ID@1) @BASE_SERIES@; urgency=medium

  * A new user is no longer offered every migration: first-run marks the
    migrations the packages ship as done at the user's first login, and the
    migration notice waits for first-run to finish, so it no longer shows
    twice. The live session, too, offered all 12.
